{"term":{"label":"性","occurrences":8,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"存","id":"存"},{"form":"害","id":"害"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"性","id":"性"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"舜","id":"舜"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"見","id":"見"},{"form":"達","id":"達"},{"form":"養","id":"養"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"養","target":"性"},{"weight":0.3508609740733126,"source":"養","target":"天"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"知","target":"心"},{"weight":1.252762968495368,"source":"知","target":"性"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"知","target":"存"},{"weight":1.0296194171811581,"source":"知","target":"舜"},{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"仁","target":"君子"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"仁","target":"心"},{"weight":0.5596157879354227,"source":"仁","target":"性"},{"weight":1.6582280766035324,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":0.3364722366212129,"source":"仁","target":"舜"},{"weight":0.8960880245566357,"source":"舜","target":"性"},{"weight":0.5331825308672671,"source":"舜","target":"天"},{"weight":0.756326082181477,"source":"天","target":"性"},{"weight":1.6317948195353769,"source":"天","target":"達"},{"weight":1.0440081546332578,"source":"天","target":"行"},{"weight":1.0440081546332578,"source":"天","target":"存"},{"weight":0.3508609740733126,"source":"天","target":"一"},{"weight":0.4906229164484712,"source":"君子","target":"大"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"君子","target":"性"},{"weight":1.6945957207744073,"source":"君子","target":"行"},{"weight":1.001448540214462,"source":"君子","target":"心"},{"weight":0.7137664677626